{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51193","headline":"五言白话诗 · 缺名","name":"五言白话诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"（原缺卷首。\n刘复云：「抄出者共四十六首。\n」现选录二十六首张锡厚《王梵志诗校辑》云与刘复所见伯三二一一卷同一系统的敦煌遗书尚有斯五四四一、斯五六四一两卷。\n其中斯五四四一卷题作「王梵志立诗集卷中」，因知伯三二一一卷诸诗亦应爲王梵志作。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"缺名","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51193.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51193","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}